WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.250
Add rides until the cost passes forty dollars.

2
00:00:04.052 --> 00:00:07.527
With no rides, you have paid the twelve dollar entry.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.930
Each ride adds four dollars fifty. Keep going while the point is under the line.

4
00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:27.122
Six rides cost thirty nine dollars. One more goes over.
